            "id": "b289ba92-288c-38e2-81f1-9d41abc07079",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Why Citizens Financial is the regional bank stock to own",
            "description": "<p>Citizens Financial Group (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CFG\">CFG</a>) received a stock upgrade to Overweight by Morgan Stanley analysts over the regional bank's improvements in credit, its return on tangible common equity (ROTCE), and its lowering of capital requirements.</p>\n<p>Citizens President Brendan Coughlin sits down with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> to uncover the so-called \"why behind the high\" as Citizens shares have risen 20% year-to-date in 2025. Coughlin discusses the company's private bank segment, its margins, and how the Federal Reserve's interest rate cuts could affect its business.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
